sequenceDiagram
  %% command: instance:rollback
  %% kind: instance.rollback
  %% status: migrated
  autonumber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant SW as Swamp
  participant N as Owning AppProd Node
  CLI->>GW: instance:rollback with the previous release name
  GW->>GW: Check the retained commit and hold this Instance
  GW->>SW: Start production-release for the retained commit
  SW->>N: Check target ownership and the current live selection
  SW->>N: Wake rollback and apply current environment
  SW->>N: Verify readiness and switch the Instance Routes
  SW->>N: Handover workloads, drain and freeze former live
  SW->>N: Read actual live and old identities
  SW-->>GW: Operation, Node, Instance, commit and artifact receipt
  GW-->>CLI: Record the verified selection and rollback outcome
